{
  "id": "KS-HB-2512-2024",
  "scope": "state:ks",
  "title": "HB 2512 (2023-2024 biennium (2024 Regular Session)): Substitute for HB 2512 by Committee on Elections - Relating to advance voting ballots; requiring county election officers to provide at least four hours of advance voting in-person on the Saturday before an election; providing after January 1, 2025, such ballots cast in-person be received in the county election office by 7:00 p.m. on the Sunday proceding the election; exception to allow voting in-person until 12:00 noon on Monday for good cause.",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/li_2024/b2023_24/measures/hb2512/",
